    pr_ref:  # 5e85
    description: "Auto-sync creates duplicate PRs when: (1) called from a feature branch (should only sync from dev), (2) previous sync PR failed to merge (should check for existing open PR before creating new one). Root cause: _maybe_auto_sync in tracker CLI fires whenever pending ops exceed threshold, regardless of current branch. This created 39 orphaned PRs in one session. Fix needed: (a) skip auto-sync when not on dev, (b) check for existing open tracker-sync PR, (c) cap retries."  # 5e85
    fields: {}  # 5e85
