  message: "Implemented circuit breaker in PR #1982: .git/TRACKER_SYNC_FAILED marker with 30-min cooldown, corrupt marker cleanup, 5 tests. Re: disabling autonomous mode when retry cap is breached — the current impl pauses sync for 30 min after each failure, but doesn't count cumulative failures or disable autonomous mode. Creating a follow-up item for the escalation behavior (N consecutive failures → turn off autonomous mode)."  # ec51
